// Service principal secret guessing followed by a success
// Agentic attack detections by ThreatDefence (general intrusion behavior, first written for ARTEX). Source: https://threatdefence.com/article/artex-agentic-attack-framework-detection-hunting
// ATT&CK: T1110.001 (Brute Force: Password Guessing), T1078.004 (Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts)
// Example hunt for Microsoft Sentinel. Test and baseline before alerting.
// Storm-0940's agents signed in as compromised applications. A source that fails with invalid client secrets
// (AADSTS7000215) or expired secrets (AADSTS7000222) and then succeeds, or that signs in as three or more
// service principals, is worth a look.

AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(14d)
| summarize Failures=countif(ResultType in ("7000215", "7000222")), Successes=countif(ResultType == "0"),
    ServicePrincipals=dcount(ServicePrincipalId), Apps=make_set(ServicePrincipalName, 20),
    Resources=make_set(ResourceDisplayName, 20), FirstSeen=min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen=max(TimeGenerated)
    by IPAddress
| where (Failures > 0 and Successes > 0) or ServicePrincipals >= 3
| order by ServicePrincipals desc, Failures desc
